{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_handoff_33_handoff_33", "label": "HANDOFF (chat 31 to chat 32), 2026-08-26", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_33_drive_canon_folder", "label": "The Method Prints and Proofs (Drive canon folder)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "lines 93-132", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It is the original-input witness and must never be used as the current tree: its Register stops at 1700 and still holds chat 12's 95 excised entries, so verifying the build against it as though current would have produced about 148 false findings in the Register alone."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_33_ruling_57_original_input_witness", "label": "Ruling 57: the folder is the original-input witness Ruling 56 points at", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "lines 98-100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_33_w_037_lowdin_arm_pass", "label": "W-037: B13's Lowdin arm passes, no finding against the tree", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "lines 173-187", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recorded as a pass because an unrecorded pass cannot be told from a check that never ran; 96 distinct numbers in the original against 115 in the tree, zero present in the original and absent from the tree."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_33_w_038_ruling_56_reach_bounded", "label": "W-038: Ruling 56's reach is bounded and narrower than assumed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "lines 189-205", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The paper states the filling rule, period lengths, exceptions, ordering clause and predictions but not the index cell counts (976, 6912, 199130 all return zero hits), so the external check cannot adjudicate IOI-05, Ruling 39's tower or SPEC-10; what it can reach is every passage restating the periodic law."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_33_ninety_five_excised_entries", "label": "The 95 excised Register entries visible in the Drive Register", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "lines 114-118", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Entries are append-only and an excision is not undone by finding an older file, so the first copy in reach since chat 12 does not reinstate them."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_33_timestamp_evidence", "label": "The timestamps that settled B13's scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "lines 126-132", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both papers were filed before Rebuild 1 opened at 23:10:27, so they are the original input at the project's start and the absorbed Chapters 35 and 36 are not; the Lowdin/three-body filing order independently corroborates the timestamp ruling's register assignment."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_handoff_33_handoff_33", "target": "recovered_handoff_32_handoff_32", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "line 189 (narrower than HANDOFF-32 assumed)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_33_handoff_33", "target": "recovered_handoff_33_drive_canon_folder", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-33.md", "source_location": "line 93", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_33_handoff